WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.938
♪♪

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:07.606
-I was on the phone with
one of the major airlines

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:09.508
trying to get back
into my account

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:11.711
'cause I couldn't remember
the password.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.845
So I finally get through --

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:14.380
-You're on
the Intelligence Committee.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.447
I just want --

00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:18.084
The president doesn't like you.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:21.220
-I'm all cinnamon, nutmeg,
allspice.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.655
-And I'm working on my biceps,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.557
you know, like,
just going like this.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.025
-I felt the Schweddy Balls
would give it away.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:26.959
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:29.829
-We don't go to school.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.064
-Ooooh.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:34.901
-Who's gonna use the word "limn"
in a sketch?

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.071
-We wanted them to add kids to
the cast of "SNL" at one point

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.940
and have, like, a little update
that they would cut to,

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.310
so they'd go from Seth and Amy
to two kids, remember?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.611
And Lorne was like,
"We're not doing that."

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:49.682
-Each job, you learn
the most just rogue skill set

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.851
that you're like, "Oh, I didn't
know I needed to know this."

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.420
And on that one, I was like,
"Oh, theme-park acting."

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.788
There's this art to it.

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:58.224
You literally --
You have to wave like that.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.326
And you have to react
all the time.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.728
Ooh!

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.163
-I had prosthetic makeup help
from, like,

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:07.433
the genius makeup artist.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.535
He's the man who won an Oscar

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:11.370
for making up Gary Oldman
as Winston Churchill.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.705
-There you go.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.974
-At the very moment when I was
playing Winston Churchill

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.576
with no makeup at all.
-Yeah.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.545
-Turns out I look
a lot like Winston Churchill.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:22.582
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.552
-I don't need
any witnesses at all.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.188
-Okay, and then --
-I am ready to go.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:31.490
I'm not trying to pretend
to be a fair juror here.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.360
-Lindsey Graham sounds like a
dude who's just making stuff up

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.828
to get out of jury duty.

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.129
"I can't serve on a jury.

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:39.298
My grandma's sick,
and I'm her caretaker.

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:41.233
And I'm cat-sitting.
I live far away.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:44.637
And I don't speak English,
and I'm biased against cops."

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.840
My favorite line from Trump's
insane letter is this --

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.442
"Since the moment
I won the election,

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:51.944
the Democratic Party has been
possessed by impeachment fever."

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:55.481
"Impeachment fever" sounds like
he's narrating an old newsreel

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.850
about The Beatles
landing in America.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.052
Impeachment fever
is sweeping the nation.

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:02.722
Look at the throngs of teenagers
screaming

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.992
as they greet the Fab Four --
Pelosi, Schumer, Schiff,

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.428
and don't forget the dumb one,
Donald.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:12.465
Uh-oh, looks like he's having
trouble with his umbrella again.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.935
-It's a snowman,
and it says "Merry Christmas."

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.136
-Uh-huh.

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.572
-And I asked them to put "Seth"
on the hat.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.940
-Yeah.
-I'm sorry.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.110
I should have gone to
the Cake Boss and got a real --

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.812
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.212
-This is a really good cake.

00:02:27.212 --> 00:02:28.414
-Here it goes. Watch out.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:31.183
-Oh, no!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:34.487
-I think they should start
making Hallmark holiday movies

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:35.788
with lesbian leads.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.122
How fun would that be?

00:02:37.122 --> 00:02:40.026
"Deck the Halls" --
two female carpenters get hired

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.494
to build a deck
the week before Christmas.

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:45.097
But instead of a deck,
they end up building a bridge

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:46.766
to each other.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.735
"All I Want for Christmas
Is Sue" --

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:52.271
a woman is hopelessly in love
with her straight co-worker Sue,

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:55.541
so she writes Santa a letter
asking him to make Sue gay.

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:57.176
And Santa does it.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.310
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.713
Then there's
"Thanks for Nothing, Santa,"

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.482
a sequel told from Sue's
husband's perspective.

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:05.551
-Watched "Grey's Anatomy"
and thought,

00:03:05.551 --> 00:03:06.986
"Oh, I'm gonna be a doctor."

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.822
-Just because of Sandra Oh
playing one on TV?

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:10.956
-Absolutely.
-Yeah.

00:03:10.956 --> 00:03:13.426
-It's an example
of bad representation

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.961
because it tricks Asian people

00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:19.065
into going into
the medical field.

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.366
-Have you waxed before?
-No.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.400
-Okay.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.303
-This all just happens
on its own.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.537
-Alright.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:29.075
♪♪

